t_sh_398" class="tp_show" onclick="teachpress_pub_showhide('398','tp_abstract')" title="Show abstract" style="cursor:pointer;">Abstract</a></span> | <span class="tp_resource_link"><a id="tp_links_sh_398" class="tp_show" onclick="teachpress_pub_showhide('398','tp_links')" title="Show links and resources" style="cursor:pointer;">Links</a></span></p><div class="tp_bibtex" id="tp_bibtex_398" style="display:none;"><div class="tp_bibtex_entry"><pre>@article{nokey,<br />
